ReplayLinkerRP is an extension resource pack for the Déesse UI pack. It provides
UI integration for compatible native replay implementations; it does not
include those implementations.

External projects referenced by this project retain their own copyrights,
licenses, trademarks, and distribution terms:

- Déesse — the base UI pack this extension targets.
- BedrockReplay — by light; used with LeviLaunchroid.
- Playback — by wo55555; a LeviLamina-based native client mod.

See README.md for project details.
